---
description: Safe editing rules for this project
alwaysApply: true
---

- Before changing code, briefly explain the intended change.
- Do not rewrite unrelated files.
- Do not introduce third-party dependencies without asking.
- Do not change the app architecture unless explicitly requested.
- Prefer small, reviewable diffs.
- When unsure, ask instead of guessing.
- Do not delete code unless it is clearly unused or I asked for it.
- After editing, summarize what changed and what I should test.
